[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352277174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3352277174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3352277174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hz7C2","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:49:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T13:49:44Z","body":"> **Please don't deprecate it!** `Color.from_rgba8` is too darn long!\r\n\r\nThe global function has already been deprecated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352277174/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352281054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3352281054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3352281054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hz7_e","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T13:50:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T13:50:39Z","body":"Yeah, bring it back from the brink! Give it love!!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352281054/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":3,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352927296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3352927296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3352927296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H2ZxA","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:18:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T16:18:33Z","body":"Admittedly, but it's unrelated to this PR, `Color.from_rgba8` could use a shorter alias, as by itself it's meant to be a shorthand of dividing every channel by `255`. The heavy need for it compared to the other named constructs should be acknowledged as games, especially retro-themed games, still use them.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352927296/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352958672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3352958672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3352958672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H2hbQ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:28:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T16:28:26Z","body":"With that said, considering that we should absolutely discourage the usage of this function, I don't think this should be merged as is. Either we no longer decide to deprecate Color8, or come up with a reasonable alternative.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352958672/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3355232983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3355232983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3355232983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H_MrX","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T08:13:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T08:13:09Z","body":"I partially agree with Mickeon. Having `Color8()` deprecated and simultaneously _offering_ it as a choice in the color picker seems a bit inconsistent to me. However, it makes sense to _support_ this option (wrapped in `#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED`) for compatibility with existing code, even if we keep `Color8()` deprecated (currently, the inline color picker doesn't appear in the script editor for `Color8()`).\r\n\r\nMay I ask, what's the problem with `Color.from_rfba8()`? Is it just that its name is too long? Personally, I usually use `Color(\"<hexcode>\")`, and coincidentally, it's the shortest notation (unless there's a named constant):\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nColor.from_rgba8(255, 128, 128)\r\nColor8(255, 128, 128)\r\nColor(\"ff8080\")\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3355232983/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3357169293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111073#issuecomment-3357169293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111073","id":3357169293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IGlaN","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T16:22:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T16:22:35Z","body":"I do a lot of 2D and retro-lospec style work where the individual numerical values often matter to me from a usability perspective. I use *exact values* of rgb in shaders, regularly perform arithmetic on individual channels, and have to communicate these values between a few different programs.\r\n\r\nHex is just cumbersome to go back/forth between at every point in the process. I mean I could do it but it's a lot of pointless conversion into base-10 to do work, leave it there for a few days/weeks while I work, and then fold it back into hex so that I can tolerate working with the code? I'd have seemingly arbitrary mixes of hex and rgba *everywhere*.\r\n\r\n<sub>(There is also a rounding error I sometimes see doing conversion between all the different forms (usually from 1.0 -> 255), values don't seem to map reversibly to rgba; however this is possibly only on my local fork? I have not confirmed the behaviour. I don't want to deal with it. 😂)</sub>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAt the end of the day, I just don't want this kind of hassle. 0-255 is very human to use and doesn't obfuscate anything that I'm trying to do. Information density is important to me, and this is more ergonomic to work with.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3357169293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]